Cell["\<\
Through an edge of the 6-cycle there are three lines, not four: the ends 5 \
and 4 are each admissible on their own side, but the pair is not.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"a849e94e-d9cf-4863-bd5d-4d8bbd841e4d"],

